<title>GERMANY: NordLB H1 97 gp net profit before provs up 6.4 pct.</title>
<headline>NordLB H1 97 gp net profit before provs up 6.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before provisions   448.3  up 6.4 pct</p>
<p>    Net commissions received		  145.2  up 14.7 pct</p>
<p>    Interest earnings			   896.1  up 6.4 pct</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total			 247.3  up 7.7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German regional bank is Norddeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
